  {
    "type": "function",
    "function": {
      "name": "gui_deeplink",
      "description": "PRIMARIA para apps nativas con URI scheme: steam, spotify, discord, slack, vscode, ms-settings, ms-windows-store, obsidian. SIEMPRE preferir esta tool antes que `web` o `filesystem` cuando el usuario menciona estas apps. Para Steam: 'biblioteca'/'library' (intent=library), 'tienda'/'store' (intent=store), 'busca X'/'search' (intent=search, params={query:X}). NO usar web_search para queries Steam — usar gui_deeplink(steam, search). NO usar filesystem para chequear si juego está instalado — usar gui_deeplink(steam, library) + gui(screenshot+locate).",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "app": {"type": "string", "enum": ["steam", "spotify", "discord", "slack", "vscode", "ms-settings", "ms-windows-store", "obsidian"]},
          "intent": {"type": "string"},
          "params": {"type": "object"}
        },
        "required": ["app", "intent"]
      }
    }
  },
